# Copies: U22 (2518) input REC (ROW_LOAD_N) stuck at 1: the row buffer always recirculates and never
# takes a row from the page, so all 16 rows show the 32 characters it held at power-on. The page itself
# is written as usual.
machine typewriter
title "Copies"
brief "Every line of the screen shows the same row of characters. Typing and Clear change nothing on the screen, though the block still moves."
fault stuck U22.REC 1
